    "sub_name": "勞動社會法",
    "sub_ename": "LABOR AND SOCIAL LAW",
    "describe_ch": "社會法的課程主要在探究社會安全制度及其法規範。而本科目重點將會著重在勞動法作為探討目標，使學生學習理論與實務判例，並有能力去解決有關勞動法之法律紛爭。",
    "describe_eh": " Social law course is to explore the social security system and its norms. The subjects will focus focused goal of labor law as to explore. The course is designed for students to study theoretical and practical legal thoughts and to resolve relevant legal disputes under Labor Law.",
